ADDITIONAL NOTICE — NOT MEDICAL ADVICE

This software generates training plans and commentary on physiological and
blood-marker data using a large language model. It is not a medical device, it
is not a substitute for professional coaching, and nothing it produces is
medical advice. It does not diagnose conditions and does not prescribe
treatments, supplements or dosages.

Endurance training carries risk of injury and illness. Consult a qualified
physician before beginning any training program, and whenever your health data
or how you feel gives you reason for concern. The authors accept no liability
for any outcome arising from use of this software.
